{"h":3179,"lines":[{"t":"Audioscripts","h":0.014534884278879168,"c":1,"x":0.098265894233391576,"y":0.046511627614788775,"w":0.11753372192382813},{"w":0.050206654866536471,"y":0.12775018107541003,"h":0.010488009902666184,"x":0.098210737984622626,"t":"CARLA:","c":1},{"x":0.10019267862363175,"w":0.034682079950968406,"y":0.14389534861200237,"c":1,"t":"ROB:","h":0.010174418995215428},{"w":0.050146373112996426,"x":0.10016766113511651,"y":0.17580154550007343,"h":0.010315513610839822,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:"},{"t":"ROB:","h":0.010174417795625113,"y":0.1918604653936119,"c":1,"w":0.034682079950968406,"x":0.10019267895515162},{"y":0.23829884142308122,"w":0.052087535858154316,"h":0.013227898219846268,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.098233689126950352,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"ROB:","x":0.098265895228824937,"w":0.03660886446634927,"y":0.28779069741893926,"h":0.011627907423103379},{"t":"CARLA:","x":0.098212574276117459,"w":0.052129764556884756,"c":1,"h":0.011902376090955347,"y":0.3675953235605578},{"h":0.0087209299675323759,"w":0.050096340179443352,"t":"CARLA.","c":1,"x":0.10019267759813959,"y":0.40843023267388134},{"w":0.036898476282755541,"h":0.012156763616597899,"y":0.42270068784037007,"c":1,"t":"ROB:","x":0.098121089582023271},{"h":0.010411447249118688,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.098224057635961828,"y":0.48825357868111152,"w":0.050180015563964828},{"x":0.1001926790354342,"y":0.5348837211651718,"w":0.034682079950968434,"c":1,"h":0.010174417795625224,"t":"ROB:"},{"t":"CARLA:","y":0.55087209328359232,"w":0.052023121515909834,"x":0.098265896178461251,"h":0.011627906223513063,"c":1},{"y":0.56831395359523518,"w":0.034682079950968434,"h":0.0087209299675323759,"c":1,"t":"ROB.","x":0.10019267861229773},{"c":1,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.10007928620062688,"y":0.59850965903444631,"h":0.010829518875985822,"w":0.050323123931884775},{"h":0.010174418995215428,"t":"ROB:","w":0.03468207995096842,"y":0.63226744163692072,"c":1,"x":0.10019267861796474},{"y":0.64757125548998051,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.09800173389570474,"w":0.050624663035074874,"h":0.0129970238643623},{"t":"ROB:","x":0.098265895228824937,"y":0.68023255791599035,"h":0.010174418995215428,"c":1,"w":0.03660886446634927},{"h":0.0087209299675322649,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.10019267871501436,"y":0.71220930243992564,"w":0.048169555664062502,"c":1},{"w":0.032755298614501951,"h":0.0087209299675323759,"t":"ROB:","y":0.72819767452546769,"x":0.10019267814939643,"c":1},{"w":0.052371196746826165,"h":0.012547522970715375,"y":0.74227275002049198,"c":1,"t":"CARLA:","x":0.096165076324220472},{"t":"ROB:","h":0.013676573795342595,"y":0.79185357343949547,"x":0.096155584958971377,"w":0.036975920995076503,"c":1},{"y":0.091509434124529165,"t":"now sea levels are rising, they're more or less useless. If there's a lot of rain, the","x":0.19653180037179283,"h":0.014595216475192796,"c":1,"w":0.59537572224934898},{"x":0.19460500355866714,"t":"water can't run away, there's nowhere for it to go. The whole design was faulty.","c":1,"y":0.10901162765256256,"w":0.58959538777669263,"h":0.013081395850991329},{"t":"So what are the authorities doing about it now?","w":0.36817883809407548,"x":0.19453210779937932,"h":0.015634661500558922,"y":0.12495290356636568,"c":1},{"y":0.14055055950906425,"w":0.61281728108723965,"h":0.0161706372626923,"t":"I don't know. I did read that they're aiming to stop disposing of waste water into","c":1,"x":0.19456493112843332},{"t":"the ocean over the next ten years.","x":0.19447812778320137,"y":0.15746145864564953,"w":0.27001096089680987,"h":0.014409916955719915,"c":1},{"x":0.19452950450579151,"y":0.17292952689384566,"h":0.016551123924975153,"t":"But that won't help with flood prevention now, will it?","c":1,"w":0.40478790283203125},{"h":0.016250194093716308,"x":0.19456454802187692,"t":"No. Really they just need to find the money for something to replace the drainage Q24","w":0.6783145141601562,"c":1,"y":0.1888749483450276},{"t":"channels, in order to protect against flooding now. But in the long term they need","x":0.19653179747725497,"c":1,"w":0.62427744547526043,"h":0.013207547169811318,"y":0.2062893083955849},{"h":0.014589593395497036,"c":1,"y":0.22124898014488203,"w":0.2622707875569662,"t":"to consider the whole ecosystem.","x":0.1944956141186408},{"w":0.61271672566731772,"y":0.23679245282561623,"x":0.19460503451701527,"c":1,"h":0.016114523425792004,"t":"Right. Really, though, coastal cities can't deal with their problems on their own,"},{"x":0.19460501174818914,"w":0.59730250040690103,"y":0.25436046483482422,"c":1,"t":"can they? I mean, they've got to start acting together at an international level","h":0.014534884278879168},{"t":"instead of just doing their own thing.","h":0.013081395850991218,"w":0.28323699951171871,"x":0.19460500690234389,"c":1,"y":0.27034883695211254},{"t":"Absolutely. The thing is, everyone knows what the problems are and","y":0.28633720902069881,"w":0.52986511230468758,"c":1,"x":0.19460501600600394,"h":0.014606187328602527},{"w":0.59344894409179694,"x":0.19653178991719622,"y":0.30220125799860686,"h":0.013207547169811207,"t":"environmentalists have a pretty good idea of what we should be doing about","c":1},{"x":0.19267823975289797,"y":0.31823899380586096,"h":0.014609843679944001,"c":1,"w":0.60693639119466147,"t":"them, so they should be able to work together to some extent. But it's going to"},{"c":1,"x":0.83622350713434235,"y":0.31831395320095779,"h":0.013081395850991329,"t":"Q25","w":0.034682079950968392},{"w":0.59730250040690103,"c":1,"y":0.33427672963762678,"h":0.014560479937859361,"t":"be a long time before countries come to a decision on what principles they're","x":0.19460501170637609},{"t":"prepared to abide by.","x":0.1962429524630297,"y":0.34891255302658064,"w":0.16439388275146483,"c":1,"h":0.016092792846871706},{"c":1,"w":0.15414258321126303,"t":"Yes, if they ever do.","x":0.19653179100515847,"y":0.36627906949592504,"h":0.01308139585099144},{"x":0.19460499790614497,"y":0.4055232555323266,"w":0.63198460896809894,"h":0.014602530377466061,"c":1,"t":"So I think we've probably got enough for our presentation. It's only fifteen minutes."},{"h":0.014779874213836419,"t":"OK. So I suppose we'll begin with some general historical background about why","x":0.1946050189853139,"y":0.42138364752555069,"w":0.62813100179036463,"c":1},{"w":0.61849711100260418,"c":1,"t":"coastal cities were established. But we don't want to spend too long on that, the","y":0.43895348811881374,"x":0.19460500895345745,"h":0.013081395850991218},{"x":0.19452953796091085,"y":0.45226019499895798,"w":0.61670003255208328,"h":0.016486345447084494,"c":1,"t":"other students will already know a bit about it. It's all to do with communications"},{"x":0.19632952778334592,"y":0.47085821428066077,"t":"and so on.","h":0.011390718424095225,"w":0.083320178985595711,"c":1},{"x":0.19267822946930827,"c":1,"y":0.48679245305101626,"w":0.59730250040690103,"t":"Yes. We should mention some geographical factors, things like wetlands and","h":0.01477987421383653},{"c":1,"t":"river estuaries and coastal erosion and so on. We could have some maps of","x":0.19460500762686442,"y":0.50283018891422915,"w":0.59344894409179694,"h":0.013207547169811318},{"y":0.51732382671206723,"h":0.014689253561151805,"t":"different cities with these features marked.","x":0.19450923176514445,"c":1,"w":0.32968406677246098},{"t":"On a handout you mean? Or some slides everyone can see?","c":1,"x":0.19453464814939783,"y":0.53339392014736087,"w":0.47412302652994798,"h":0.015715771801066758},{"h":0.017481134522635999,"t":"Yeah, that'd be better.","x":0.19432159435011068,"y":0.54931906633897343,"w":0.17200055440266929,"c":1},{"x":0.19260802964011001,"w":0.61671386718749999,"y":0.56438423648054514,"h":0.017522452012547984,"t":"It'd be good to go into past mistakes in a bit more detail. Did you read that case","c":1},{"w":0.62427744547526043,"t":"study of the problems there were in New Orleans with flooding a few years ago?","h":0.016088927766811922,"x":0.19267823285409141,"y":0.58139534912754542,"c":1},{"t":"Yes. We could use that as the basis for that part of the talk. I don't think the other","c":1,"x":0.19262645498503256,"h":0.016022662996496129,"y":0.59735429195094114,"w":0.59932647705078135},{"y":0.61477987432301184,"h":0.014580591069827231,"t":"students will have read it, but they'Il remember hearing about the flooding at the time.","c":1,"x":0.19267821770757051,"w":0.63391138712565098},{"t":"Ok. So that's probably enough background.","x":0.19460500710982753,"y":0.63081395320522093,"h":0.014534884278879168,"c":1,"w":0.34296724955240876},{"t":"So then we'll go on to talk about what action's being taken to deal with the","y":0.64532344393243901,"w":0.57430099487304687,"x":0.19453891133563625,"h":0.017253755173593177,"c":1},{"h":0.015959025928809267,"y":0.66143836208015894,"c":1,"x":0.19254489759868346,"t":"problems of coastal cities.","w":0.20646825154622392},{"x":0.19446749221258519,"t":"OK. What else do we need to talk about? Maybe something on future risks,","y":0.67664173661148841,"w":0.58411321004231775,"h":0.018186773144224122,"c":1},{"w":0.48379816691080735,"t":"looking more at the long term, if populations continue to grow.","h":0.017326630286450651,"x":0.19066684284751725,"y":0.69359464040941998,"c":1},{"w":0.63210688273111981,"y":0.70920765171837752,"t":"Yeah. We'll need to do a bit of work there, I haven't got much information, have you?","x":0.19261242235251946,"h":0.018341359552347503,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.72429206173071192,"h":0.018548057364217829,"t":"No. We'll need to look at some websites. Shouldn't take too long.","x":0.19255279975369169,"w":0.50702016194661459},{"h":0.017679832266561668,"y":0.74121325082901479,"w":0.62247762044270827,"c":1,"t":"OK. And I think we should end by talking about international implications. Maybe","x":0.19453793436552852},{"h":0.014549510284039946,"x":0.19075144794239945,"c":1,"t":"we could ask people in the audience. We've got people from quite a lot of","y":0.75872092995084117,"w":0.57418111165364594},{"y":0.77242429023244541,"t":"different places.","w":0.12813799540201826,"c":1,"h":0.015556836877978819,"x":0.19223856717856141},{"y":0.79213836467898868,"h":0.014547682108369209,"x":0.19460501334886751,"w":0.47976877848307298,"c":1,"t":"That'd be interesting, if we have time, yes. So now shall we ..."},{"h":0.01308139585099144,"w":0.036608864466349256,"y":0.43749999970804354,"x":0.8342967237458716,"c":1,"t":"Q26"},{"x":0.83429672374520258,"y":0.53488372067475309,"h":0.011627907423103379,"c":1,"t":"Q27","w":0.036608864466349256},{"x":0.83429672374520258,"t":"Q28","y":0.59883720901491133,"w":0.036608864466349256,"h":0.013081395850991218,"c":1},{"t":"Q29","c":1,"y":0.72674418623171233,"x":0.83429672511254471,"w":0.036608861287434902,"h":0.013081394651401013},{"h":0.013081394651401013,"c":1,"t":"Q30","x":0.83429672528113796,"w":0.036608861287435013,"y":0.75872093051586931},{"c":1,"y":0.84302325552554069,"x":0.098265893137884419,"w":0.15221580505371091,"t":"SECTION 4","h":0.014534884278879279},{"y":0.87157943348000977,"w":0.71304407755533861,"t":"Producing enough energy to meet our needs has become a serious problem. Demand is rising","h":0.01798821515257254,"c":1,"x":0.09627664876396172},{"w":0.68796849568684892,"t":"rapidly, because of the world's increasing population and expanding industry. Burning fossil","h":0.017983271041006388,"x":0.094361036488015484,"y":0.88799594353515987,"c":1},{"w":0.7014902750651042,"h":0.017502841109749645,"c":1,"t":"fuels, like gas, coal and oil, seriously damages the environment and they'll eventually run out.","x":0.096266179867876167,"y":0.90447476343943467},{"x":0.096280755841537488,"w":0.70146092732747389,"h":0.017645768699406039,"c":1,"y":0.92117507039579782,"t":"For a number of years now, scientists have been working out how we can derive energy from"},{"y":0.95058139563214838,"w":0.032755298614501965,"x":0.10019267819756597,"h":0.013081394651401013,"c":1,"t":"100"},{"w":0.034682079950968392,"t":"Q31","x":0.83429672486640627,"h":0.013081395850991329,"c":1,"y":0.89098837180347146}],"w":2400}